# Title: Remote Access Tool - ScreenConnect Potential Suspicious Remote Command Execution
# ID: 7b582f1a-b318-4c6a-bf4e-66fe49bf55a5
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), @Kostastsale
# Date: 2022-02-25
# Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1219.002
# Description: Detects potentially suspicious child processes launched via the ScreenConnect client service.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((parent_process_exec="*:\\Windows\\TEMP\\ScreenConnect\\*" AND parent_process_exec="*run.cmd*") AND (process_path="*\\bitsadmin.exe" OR process_path="*\\cmd.exe" OR process_path="*\\curl.exe" OR process_path="*\\dllhost.exe" OR process_path="*\\net.exe" OR process_path="*\\nltest.exe" OR process_path="*\\powershell.exe" OR process_path="*\\pwsh.exe" OR process_path="*\\rundll32.exe" OR process_path="*\\wevtutil.exe"))
